Nick Frost has said a couple things about
his character. He said

00:03:45.389 --> 00:03:49.350
"My Santa is cross, mean, and curt as well
as cheery and funny

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:52.709
which seems kinda all over the place,
it seems a little bipolar. He's got a little bit

